infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title When you ack fixes your delivery guarantee
  desc Over an unreliable network, process and ack can't be atomic — pick your failure mode
  compares
    - label at-most-once
      children
        - label Ack BEFORE processing
          desc Acknowledge first, then do the work
        - label No duplicates
          desc A message is never redelivered
        - label Possible loss
          desc Crash mid-process and the work is gone
    - label at-least-once
      children
        - label Ack AFTER processing
          desc Do the work, then acknowledge
        - label No loss
          desc Crash before ack and it redelivers
        - label Possible duplicates
          desc The safe default — make the consumer idempotent
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
